{"html":"<div class=\"led-customization\"><section class=\"led-hero\"><div class=\"container-site\"><nav class=\"led-breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a><span>/</span><a href=\"/#capabilities\">Capabilities</a><span>/</span><span>LED customization</span></nav><div class=\"led-hero-grid\"><div><p class=\"led-eyebrow\">PRODUCT CUSTOMIZATION CAPABILITY</p><h1>Custom LED Drinkware<br>& Bar Accessories</h1><p class=\"led-intro\">Explore custom LED drinkware, light-up cups, LED ice buckets and branded bar accessories. Review product models, logo options, LED configuration and the production workflow for your project.</p><div class=\"led-ctas\"><a href=\"/contact/?topic=custom-led-drinkware\" data-led-quote class=\"led-button\">Discuss an LED project ↗</a><a href=\"#led-products\" class=\"led-button led-button-outline\">Explore product models ↓</a></div><p class=\"led-small\">Specification, MOQ and delivery terms confirmed for the selected project.</p></div><div class=\"led-hero-visual\"><img src=\"/img/led-scenes-20261024/step-4-optimized.webp\" alt=\"BOOM Drinkware LED Light Up Color Changing Glow Cups\" width=\"700\" height=\"700\" fetchpriority=\"high\"><div class=\"led-hero-caption\"><span>FGB-034</span><span>SCENE CONCEPT · PRODUCT REFERENCE</span></div></div></div></div></section>\n\n <section id=\"led-production\" class=\"led-section led-journey\"><div class=\"container-site\"><div class=\"led-section-head\"><p class=\"led-eyebrow\">FROM PRODUCT BRIEF TO SAMPLE APPROVAL</p><h2>Your brand. Brought to light.</h2><p>Follow the product, lighting and branding decisions that shape your LED project.</p></div><div class=\"led-journey-grid\"><div><div role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"LED production process\" aria-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"led-journey-tabs\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"led-tab-0\" aria-controls=\"led-panel-0\" aria-selected=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" data-led-step=\"0\"><span>01</span><strong>Brief & model selection</strong><small>Approve the product brief and sample requirements.</small></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"led-tab-1\" aria-controls=\"led-panel-1\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-led-step=\"1\"><span>02</span><strong>Shell & logo decoration</strong><small>Approve the physical decoration sample.</small></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"led-tab-2\" aria-controls=\"led-panel-2\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-led-step=\"2\"><span>03</span><strong>LED module & assembly</strong><small>Check assembly, switches and component retention.</small></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"led-tab-3\" aria-controls=\"led-panel-3\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-led-step=\"3\"><span>04</span><strong>Light check & packing</strong><small>Approve inspection, packing and shipping scope.</small></button></div><a class=\"led-text-link\" data-led-quote href=\"/contact/\">Discuss the process for your project →</a></div><div class=\"led-journey-panels\"><div role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"led-panel-0\" aria-labelledby=\"led-tab-0\" data-led-panel=\"0\" ><figure><img class=\"led-process-photo\" src=\"/img/led-scenes-20261024/step-1-optimized.webp\" alt=\"Brief & model selection\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"eager\"><figcaption>SCENE CONCEPT · NOT FACTORY PHOTOGRAPHY <b>01 / 04</b></figcaption></figure><h3>Brief & model selection</h3><p>Start with a cup, ice bucket or bar accessory. Agree the intended use, dimensions, logo, quantity, destination and required arrival date. New shapes need a separate tooling review.</p><div class=\"led-journey-controls\"><button type=\"button\" data-led-prev disabled>← Previous</button><span>Approve the product brief and sample requirements.</span><button type=\"button\" data-led-next >Next →</button></div></div><div role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"led-panel-1\" aria-labelledby=\"led-tab-1\" data-led-panel=\"1\" hidden><figure><img class=\"led-process-photo\" src=\"/img/led-scenes-20261024/step-2-optimized.webp\" alt=\"Shell & logo decoration\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>SCENE CONCEPT · NOT FACTORY PHOTOGRAPHY <b>02 / 04</b></figcaption></figure><h3>Shell & logo decoration</h3><p>Prepare the selected shell and review material, dimensions, artwork placement and decoration. Approve the physical sample before the production run.</p><div class=\"led-journey-controls\"><button type=\"button\" data-led-prev >← Previous</button><span>Approve the physical decoration sample.</span><button type=\"button\" data-led-next >Next →</button></div></div><div role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"led-panel-2\" aria-labelledby=\"led-tab-2\" data-led-panel=\"2\" hidden><figure><img class=\"led-process-photo\" src=\"/img/led-scenes-20261024/step-3-optimized.webp\" alt=\"LED module & assembly\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>SCENE CONCEPT · NOT FACTORY PHOTOGRAPHY <b>03 / 04</b></figcaption></figure><h3>LED module & assembly</h3><p>Confirm lighting colours, modes, activation and power arrangements. Fit the compatible LED module and check the switches, closures and component retention.</p><div class=\"led-journey-controls\"><button type=\"button\" data-led-prev >← Previous</button><span>Check assembly, switches and component retention.</span><button type=\"button\" data-led-next >Next →</button></div></div><div role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"led-panel-3\" aria-labelledby=\"led-tab-3\" data-led-panel=\"3\" hidden><figure><img class=\"led-process-photo\" src=\"/img/led-scenes-20261024/step-4-optimized.webp\" alt=\"Light check & packing\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>SCENE CONCEPT · NOT FACTORY PHOTOGRAPHY <b>04 / 04</b></figcaption></figure><h3>Light check & packing</h3><p>Check lighting, appearance and logo against the approved sample. Confirm care instructions, protective packaging and battery transport requirements for the order.</p><div class=\"led-journey-controls\"><button type=\"button\" data-led-prev >← Previous</button><span>Approve inspection, packing and shipping scope.</span><button type=\"button\" data-led-next disabled>Next →</button></div></div></div></div></div></section> <section class=\"led-section\"><div class=\"container-site\"><div class=\"led-section-head\"><p class=\"led-eyebrow\">CUSTOMIZATION SCOPE</p><h2>Define what makes it yours.</h2><p>Choose the product first. Review the configuration and sample before committing to production.</p></div><div class=\"led-spec-layout\"><table aria-label=\"LED customization specifications\"><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">PRODUCT & STRUCTURE</th><td>Selected cup, ice bucket or bar accessory; review material, dimensions and fit.</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">LIGHTING & ACTIVATION</th><td>Colours, modes and activation depend on the selected LED module.</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">POWER CONFIGURATION</th><td>Battery access or charging arrangements confirmed by model and sample.</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">LOGO & ARTWORK</th><td>Review process, placement and readability with lights on and off.</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">CARE & TESTING</th><td>Agree care instructions and required tests; review the actual model.</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">MOQ & LEAD TIME</th><td>Quoted for the selected model, configuration, quantity and packaging.</td></tr></tbody></table><aside><h3>BEST FOR</h3><p>Branded events<br>Bars & beverage promotions<br>Custom light-up gift projects</p><h3>CONFIRM BY SAMPLE</h3><p>Light effect, power access, decoration and care requirements for the selected model.</p></aside></div></div></section>\n <section id=\"led-products\" class=\"led-section\"><div class=\"container-site\"><div class=\"led-section-head\"><p class=\"led-eyebrow\">PRODUCT MODELS / BOOM Drinkware</p><h2>The LED collection. Made for your brand.</h2><p>Browse the existing model library. Product references help define the project; final specifications and supply conditions are confirmed in the quotation.</p></div><di